ateDate\":null,\"content\":\"Dân tình đặc biệt là các hội nhóm bỉm sữa đã tiếp tục đào lại lịch sử hoạt động của tài khoản Facebook liên quan và phát hiện ra một sự thật gây sốc.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"New Air France KLM Credit Card Offer [Up to 100K Bonus Miles and 100 XP]\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/air-france-klm-credit-card-offer-100k-miles/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Air-France-KLM-Visa-Signature-Upgraded-Points-LLC.jpeg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-23T02:07:51.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Are you familiar with the Air France KLM Visa Signature® Credit Card ? Probably not, since it’s not very well-known in the points and miles community. Issued by Bank of America, the card features an $89 annual fee and has a few different benefits, including a 5,000-mile account anniversary bonus. More interesting than that, however, is the card’s limited-time welcome offer. Let’s take a look. Offer Details There aren’t published dates for when this Air France KLM Visa card will end, which means if you’re interested, you’ll want to jump on it sooner rather than later: Earn 70,000 bonus miles after spending $3,000 in the first 90 days of card ownership, plus a bonus of 100 XP (Experience Points), awarding Flying Blue Silver status Plus, earn an additional 30,000 bonus miles after you make $7,500 or more in purchases within the first 6 months (180 days) of account opening. Direct link to offer . Screenshot: Bank of America This may not seem like a huge deal, but you can regularly find business class award space on Air France or KLM to Europe for 60,000 miles and under, meaning this bonus can potentially be worth thousands of dollars — and that’s not bad for just $3,000 in spend. In addition to the welcome offer, the card features: 3x miles on Air France, KLM, and SkyTeam purchases 3x miles on dining 3x miles on rent payments through Bilt, on up to $50,000 annually 1.5x miles on all other purchases 5,000-mile bonus each year on your account anniversary every year during which you’ve spent $50 or more on the card 20 XP every year on your account anniversary, plus an additional 80 XP (totaling 100 XP) after you spend $15,000 or more on purchases within the anniversary year, and another 60 XP (totaling 160 XP) after spending at least $25,000 on your card in a calendar year The benefits of this card are thin on the ground, but keep in mind that it’s a Visa Signature card , which comes with a bevy of perks. » Related: Flying Blue Introduces New (And Improved!) Air France KLM Visa Card in the U.S. Is It Worth It? The fact that you’ve probably never heard of this card can probably tell you whether it’s worth a great slot in your wallet. If you’re bumping up against Chase’s 5/24 , obviously, this card isn’t one you’d like to acquire. However, if you’re looking for a new card and any chance of getting one with other major card issuers is shot, you may want to consider going after this one. With this welcome offer, you can easily earn more than your money’s worth out of your miles, especially when you take advantage of Air France’s rotating Promo Rewards . After spending $3,000 on purchases to earn the first-tier welcome offer, you’ll have a minimum of 73,000 Flying Blue miles. That’s nearly enough for you and a friend to fly round-trip to Europe . Not bad! Hot Tip: Flying Blue miles are easy to earn , as you can transfer from American Express Membership Rewards , Bilt Rewards , Capital One Miles ,  Chase Ultimate Rewards , Citi ThankYou Rewards , and Wells Fargo Rewards at a 1:1 ratio. You can also transfer from Brex Rewards at a 3:2 ratio. Marriott Bonvoy points transfer at a 3:1 ratio with a 5,000-mile bonus for every 60,000 points transferred. Final Thoughts It’s always good news when a credit card comes out with a limited-time offer. In this case, though, it’s probably not a card with which you’re familiar. Still, if you’re looking to quickly boost your Flying Blue balance, it may be worth getting in while the getting is good. Otherwise, take advantage of the program’s multiple partnerships to snag those discounted reward flights.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Những bước chân thầm lặng trong đêm – Vì bình yên giấc ngủ của Nhân dân\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/nhung-buoc-chan-tham-lang-trong-dem-%E2%80%93-vi-binh-yen-giac-ngu-cua-nhan-dan.1263014/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fnhung-buoc-chan-tham-lang-trong-dem-%25E2%2580%2593-vi-binh-yen-giac-ngu-cua-nhan-dan.1263014&rss=https%3A%2F%2Fcongan.gialai.gov.vn%2Fuploads%2Fnews%2F2026_07%2F1_24.jpg&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-23T02:01:54.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-23T08:50:45+0700\",\"content\":\"Khi phố phường dần chìm vào giấc ngủ, khi nhiều gia đình đã khép cửa sau một ngày lao động, cũng là lúc những cán bộ, chiến sĩ Công an phường Diên Hồng tiếp tục lên đường thực hiện nhiệm vụ tuần tra, kiểm soát, giữ gìn an ninh, trật tự trên địa bàn. Lực lượng tuần tra của Công an phường tại Công viên Diên Hồng Tối 21/7/2026, Công an phường Diên Hồng đã tổ chức tuần tra đêm tại các tuyến đường, khu dân cư, công viên và những... Click to expand... Read more\",\"replyCount\":6,\"viewCount\":3},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Đi từng ngõ, gõ từng nhà, rà từng thửa đất\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/di-tung-ngo-go-tung-nha-