usiness\",\"title\":\"What Is Section 338? The Tool Trump Is Using to Threaten Canada With 50% Tariffs\",\"link\":\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-07-22/what-is-section-338-the-tool-trump-is-using-to-threaten-canada-with-50-tariffs\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bloomberg.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2F2026-07-22%2Fwhat-is-section-338-the-tool-trump-is-using-to-threaten-canada-with-50-tariffs&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dfeeds.bloomberg.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T17:35:30.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"US President Donald Trump is reaching for a tariff power that has sat unused since Congress created it during the Great Depression. After the Supreme Court invalidated his use of an emergency powers law to advance his second-term trade agenda, Trump is turning to Section 338 of the Tariff Act of 1930 to threaten 50% duties on certain imports from Canada. He said the move is in response to what he describes as Canada’s unfair treatment of dairy, alcohol, and cars from the US.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/chuyen-tro-linh-tinh-tm.17/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Chuyện trò linh tinh™\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Đêm mưa stress công việc không ngủ được\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/dem-mua-stress-cong-viec-khong-ngu-duoc.1262976/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fdem-mua-stress-cong-viec-khong-ngu-duoc.1262976&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T17:32:25.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-23T00:32:25+0700\",\"content\":\"Tình hình là mình đang làm ở một công ty điện tử, cũng sắp tròn một năm, từ người không có kinh nghiệm gì đến mức thạo việc, một tháng làm 2 thứ 7, OT 40h thì được 19tr, mỗi ngày mất 2h đi lại. Công việc của mình thì không quá khó khăn, mỗi ngày đi bộ