ead more\",\"replyCount\":7330,\"viewCount\":374000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Goldman says the M&A boom has room to run, flags new takeover candidates\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/22/goldman-says-the-ma-boom-has-room-to-run-flags-new-takeover-candidates.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F22%2Fgoldman-says-the-ma-boom-has-room-to-run-flags-new-takeover-candidates.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T16:08:57.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Deal activity has increased sequentially in every month this year, fueled by easy financial conditions and steady economic growth, the firm said.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Alphabet earnings takeaways: Q2 revenue beats, GOOGL stock sinks on 2026 capex hike\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/22/google-earnings-q2-goog-live-updates.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F22%2Fgoogle-earnings-q2-goog-live-updates.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T16:08:30.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Google parent Alphabet reported second-quarter earnings after the bell on Wednesday.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"[Award Alert] Waldorf Astoria New York: Book Early 2027 Award Stays From 150K Points\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/award-alert-waldorf-astoria-new-york/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Waldorf-Astoria-Exterior-Front.jpeg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-22T16:05:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Ever since the Waldorf Astoria New York reopened after an extensive renovation, award availability has been extremely limited. Standard room redemptions have been hard to come by, even for travelers willing to plan far in advance. However, we found award availability from January through May 2027, with standard rooms available from 150,000 Hilton Honors points per night . Let’s take a look. Book the Waldorf Astoria New York With Points Since reopening following its multiyear renovation, the Waldorf Astoria New York has been notoriously difficult to book with points. Standard room award availability has been extremely limited, making the newly released award space in early 2027 all the more noteworthy. » Related: Waldorf Astoria New York Reopens Early: What’s New at the Iconic Hotel If you want to book a points stay at the Waldorf Astoria New York, you’ll want to aim for an early 2027 visit. Image Credit: Waldorf Astoria New York If you’re looking to visit New York City and stay at this iconic hotel, we’re seeing widespread availability from January through May 2027 , starting at 150,000 Hilton Honors points per night . Rooms available for 150k Hilton points, captured on July 22. Screenshot: Hilton website Considering cash rates often start at $1,000 per night and climb higher , this is a prime opportunity to redeem Hilton Honors points and experience a Manhattan icon without paying full price. Award nights can also be booked using Hilton free night certificates , such as those earned with the Hilton Honors American Express Aspire Card . This makes it a smart option for points-savvy travelers. How To Find Award Availability To quickly search for award availability, calendar views through tools like Rooms.aero or MaxMyPoint come in handy. Alternatively, you can use the Shop by Price function on Hilton’s website to see when standard award nights are available. Using the Shop by Price feature allows you to easily see award availability. Screenshot: Hilton website The quickest way to earn Hilton Honors points is through credit card welcome offers . However, you can also top off your Hilton account by transferring points from American Express Membership Rewards at a 1:2 ratio (1 Amex point to 2 Hilton points). Hot Tip: Still low on points? Right now, you can buy Hilton Honors points with up to a 100% bonus ! This offer ends on July 24, 2026. Final Thoughts The Waldorf Astoria New York represents a rare combination of iconic history, a prime Manhattan location, and newly updated luxury. While standard award nights are limited throughout 2026, availability opens up considerably from January through May 2027 , giving Hilton Honors members a rare opportunity to redeem points or free night certificates at the newly restored property without paying sky-high cash rates. If a New York City bucket-list stay is on your radar, now is the time to plan.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/investing_news.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"All News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"White House accuses Moonshot of violating US export controls using Nvidia hardware\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/white-house-accuses-moonshot-of-violating-us-export-controls-using-nvidia-hardware-4806584\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fnews%2Fstock-market-news%2Fwhite-house-accuses-moonshot-of-violating-us-export-controls-using-nvidia-hardware-4806584&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2