ge%3Fsource%3Dfeed_tag_etf_portfolio_strategy&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dseekingalpha.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T19:01:47.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://baomoi.com/\",\"feedTitle\":\"Znews • Thể thao\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=znews.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"News\",\"title\":\"Người hùng World Cup 2026 thành 'hàng hot'\",\"link\":\"https://znews.vn/nguoi-hung-world-cup-2026-thanh-hang-hot-post1671291.html\",\"image\":\"https://photo-baomoi.bmcdn.me/w250_r3x2/2026_07_22_119_55665719/7a83d14b9f00765e2f11.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T19:00:56.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Người hùng World Cup 2026 thành 'hàng hot'\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Hacker News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=news.ycombinator.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Advertise in ChatGPT\",\"link\":\"https://ads.openai.com/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fads.openai.com%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dnews.ycombinator.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:58:44.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Comments\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Buy EVA Air Miles With up to a 40% Bonus [Until August 5]\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/buy-eva-air-miles/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/EVA-Air-B777-300ER-landing-LAX.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T18:50:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"It has a long name, some interesting quirks, and it probably isn’t the first airline you think of in Star Alliance, but there’s value to be found in the EVA Air Infinity MileageLands program — and you can buy miles with up to a 40% bonus right now. If you maximize this promotion, you can buy miles for as little as 2.86 cents each, though the offer runs only through August 5. Should you buy EVA Air miles with this sale? Let’s take a look at the details. Buy EVA Air Infinity MileageLands Miles — Offer Details Right now, you can buy EVA Air Infinity MileageLands miles for as little as 2.86 cents apiece, thanks to a promotion offering up to a 40% bonus . But the sale ends on August 5, 2026. This is a tiered offer , so you’ll get a better discount the more miles you buy: Buy 1,000 to 2,000 miles without a bonus Buy 3,000 to 15,000 miles with a 10% bonus Buy 16,000 to 35,000 miles with a 25% bonus Buy 36,000+ miles with a 40% bonus (2.86 cents each) Direct link to purchase If you buy the maximum number of miles, 150,000, you’ll receive 210,000 miles after the 40% bonus and pay $6,000 , which results in a per-mile cost of 2.86 cents. Image Credit: Alberto Riva There are some terms you should know for this promotion to buy EVA Air miles: You can buy up to 150,000 miles annually. You must buy miles in increments of 1,000. Purchased miles are valid for 36 months before expiring. Purchasing in U.S. dollars is typically 2% to 3% cheaper than buying in Taiwan Dollars. Hot Tip: EVA Air sells miles through Points.com, so the purchase won’t code as airfare on your credit card. Which credit card should you use to buy EVA miles? Use your best credit card for everyday spending or a card with a nice welcome bonus you’re working on right now. Is It Worth It? EVA Air may not be the best-known airline around, but it’s a valuable Star Alliance partner, and there are some high-value uses for EVA Air miles . These include around-the-world tickets , business class tickets between the U.S. and Europe for 65,000 miles per passenger , and transcontinental business class within the U.S. for 29,000 miles per passenger. Plus, you can get creative with your award bookings, adding open jaws, up to 2 stopovers, or booking one-way awards. You can also change the date of an award booking for free. However, Infinity MileageLands does tack on fuel surcharges on awards , so be wary of those. » Related: How To Maximize Stopovers and Open-Jaws [Ultimate Guide] It’s also worth noting that some award costs can be higher than those with partners, so shopping around is important before deciding to buy points and miles . However, the most critical element for EVA Air award reservations is that you can’t book an award where more than 50% of the miles were purchased . That really affects the value proposition of purchasing Infinity MileageLands miles. While it’s helpful for those who need to top up their account for a redemption, it’s not helpful for someone who wants to buy miles because it could be cheaper than buying a flight with cash and paying the full price. If you already have some EVA miles and want to redeem them, buying miles could help you cross the finish line. However, there are other ways to earn EVA miles , including transfers from Capital One miles and Citi ThankYou Rewards . Citi transfers are 1:1, though Capital One transfers are 4:3, so bear that in mind. Final Thoughts Through August 5, you can buy EVA Air miles with up to a 40% bonus. Should you buy miles? It can make sense if you understand this program’s strengths and weaknesses and are aware of the 50% rule for award tickets.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"( Mỹ ) Nhớ lại \\\"Tháng Tám Đỏ\\\" của Trung Quốc\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/my-nho-lai-thang-tam-do-cua-trung-quoc.1260027/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fmy-nho-lai-thang-tam-do-cua-trung-quoc.1260027&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fww