ck up some extra savings. Let’s take a look at the details of this offer. What Are Chase Offers? Chase Offers are targeted deals on your Chase credit cards that can provide cash-back or bonus points when you spend with the merchant listed on the offer. These offers can be found in the Chase mobile app ( iOS , Android ) or online portal . You’ll see a list of merchants offering cash-back or savings when you purchase through them. To use a Chase offer, you must activate it by adding it to your card before making a qualifying purchase , and complete the purchase before the expiration date listed on the offer. » Related: The Best Current Chase Offers [Travel, Dining, Entertainment, Shopping] Air Canada Chase Offer — The Details If targeted for this offer, you can get $100 in cash-back on airfare with Air Canada when you spend $1,000 or more . Your airfare must be purchased directly from Air Canada, either on its website , through its mobile app ( iOS , Android ), or by phone, and the full amount must be paid in a single transaction. Air Canada can be a great option to fly to Europe , and fares can be pretty reasonable. Screenshot: Chase This offer expires on September 18, 2026 , so if you’re looking to save on your Air Canada flight, you’ll want to add this offer to your account and firm up your travel plans by then so you can make a qualifying transaction in time. This is a one-time-only offer , so even if you spend $2,000 on airfare with Air Canada, the maximum cash-back you can receive is $100. Hot Tip: Most Chase Offers trigger based on the date they post to your account. Be sure to purchase your airfare a few days before the September 18, 2026, deadline, so you have enough time for the offer to post. Is It Worth It? If you’re considering traveling with Air Canada, it is definitely worth adding this offer to your Chase credit card to earn cash-back. Additionally, if you have multiple flight options that are approximately the same price, this Chase Offer can help make that decision easier for you. If you have this offer available on multiple Chase credit cards, you’ll want to add it to the card with the best earnings on airfare or general travel purchases . Final Thoughts If you’re headed to Canada or beyond soon, be sure to take advantage of this Chase Offer for $100 back on Air Canada flights. Remember, though, make your purchase directly with Air Canada a few days before the offer expires on September 18.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/stock.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Stock Markets Analysis & Opinion\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"IBM Just Had Its Worst Day Ever—What Earnings Must Prove\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/ibm-just-had-its-worst-day-everwhat-earnings-must-prove-200684305\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fanalysis%2Fibm-just-had-its-worst-day-everwhat-earnings-must-prove-200684305&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dwww.investing.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T15:02:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Google expands Gemini lineup with cheaper models and new Mythos rival\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/21/google-gemini-flash-ai-mythos-rival.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F21%2Fgoogle-gemini-flash-ai-mythos-rival.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T15:00:02.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Google is expanding Gemini with cheaper, more efficient mod