nced Fitbit Air , the Cirqa uses a combination of heart rate, blood oxygen, skin temperature, and motion sensors to monitor your health and activities around the clock, but without any subscription fees. The Garmin Cirqa is available now through the company's online store for $199.99 and comes with an adjustable fabric strap in several different colors that can be worn … Read the full story at The Verge.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://genk.vn/rss/home.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Genk.vn\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=genk.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Chưa tới 100.000đ nhưng đáng tiền bất ngờ: Món đồ nhiều người tiếc vì không mua sớm\",\"link\":\"https://genk.vn/chua-toi-100000d-nhung-dang-tien-bat-ngo-mon-do-nhieu-nguoi-tiec-vi-khong-mua-som-16526072119403217.chn\",\"image\":\"https://genk.mediacdn.vn/zoom/700_438/139269124445442048/2026/7/21/avatar1784637453867-1784637454426324490275-62-0-562-800-crop-17846374805021807519683.png\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:37:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Giá chỉ bằng một bữa ăn sáng, nhưng sau khi dùng, nhiều người đều có chung cảm giác: đáng lẽ nên mua sớm hơn.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"[Dịch][Độc Quyền Hoàn Cầu Thời Báo] Hình ảnh cho chứng minh cảnh sát biển Trung Quốc bị hải quân Philippines hành hung gây thương tích.\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/dich-doc-quyen-hoan-cau-thoi-bao-hinh-anh-cho-chung-minh-canh-sat-bien-trung-quoc-bi-hai-quan-philippines-hanh-hung-gay-thuong-tich.1262600/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fdich-doc-quyen-hoan-cau-thoi-bao-hinh-anh-cho-chung-minh-canh-sat-bien-trung-quoc-bi-hai-quan-philippines-hanh-hung-gay-thuong-tich.1262600&rss=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Fattachments%2F9fc64193-6bb4-4701-9af8-81c572c2c01a-webp.3723576%2F&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:34:42.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-21T20:29:49+0700\",\"content\":\"[Hoàn cầu thời báo ngày 21 tháng 7 năm 2026] Một sĩ quan cảnh sát biển Trung Quốc bị thương trong vụ tấn công ác ý do phía Philippines​ Trong vụ việc mới nhất, khi tàu số 57 của Philippines \\\"mắc cạn\\\" trái phép và triển khai hai xuồng cao su tiếp cận một tàu tuần tra nhỏ của Lực lượng Cảnh sát biển Trung Quốc một cách nguy hiểm ở vùng biển gần Ren'ai Jiao, Trung Quốc, hình ảnh do Global Times thu được hôm thứ Ba cho thấy một sĩ quan thực thi pháp luật... Click to expand... Read more\",\"replyCount\":41,\"viewCount\":3000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Why I Never Use the Chase Sapphire Preferred by Itself\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/chase-sapphire-preferred-card-pairing-strategy/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Chase-Freedom-Unlimited-Payment-Terminal.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:30:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The Chase Sapphire Preferred® Card is a good standalone card, but it becomes more useful when paired with other cards that earn bonus rewards in complementary categories. While it may sound complicated to juggle multiple credit cards, Chase makes it easy to pair its cards together. You’ll only ever need to memorize one account log-in, and you can combine your rewards instantly online. In fact, building a 3-card Chase trifecta can help you maximize rewards on every dollar you spend — while staying under a combined $100 in annual fees. Here’s a look at all of the possibilities. Chase Sapphire Preferred Welcome Offer Details The Chase Sapphire Preferred card currently has an elevated welcome offer: Earn 75,000 100,000 points after spending $5,000 on purchases in the first 3 months. If you don’t already have the Chase Sapphire Preferred card in your wallet, this limited-time bonus offer is worth considering. It matches the largest welcome offer we’ve seen on the Chase Sapphire Preferred card . The previous welcome offer was 75,000 points , meaning the 100,000-point welcome bonus offers 33.3% more points. With the Chase Sapphire Preferred card as your main anchor card, you can take advantage of its benefits and get full access to the Chase transfer partners. The Chase Sapphire Preferred card offers a great combination of travel perks, including a $100 annual Chase Travel hotel credit , and a Global Entry/TSA PreCheck/NEXUS credit, along with travel protections including primary rental car insurance , trip delay insurance, and no foreign transaction fees. » Related: The Chase Sapphire Preferred Card’s 100,000-Point Welcome Offer Is Ending Soon Cards To Pair With the Chase Sapphire Preferred Card The 2 best personal cards to pair with the Chase Sapphire Preferred card are the Chase Freedom Unlimited® and the Chase Freedom Flex® : SCROLL FOR MORE Card Feature Freedom Unlimited Card Freedom Flex Card Welcome Offer Earn a $200 Bonus after you spend $500 on purchases in your first 3 months from account opening Earn a $200 bonus after you spend $500 on purchases in your first 3 months. Earning Rates 5% back on travel purchased through Chase Travel 3% back on dining and drugstore purchases 1.5% back on all other purchases 5% back on quarterly bonus categories (up to $1,500 per quarter) and travel purchases through Chase Travel 3% back on dining and drugstore purchases 1% back on all other purchases Card Benefits 0% Intro APR for 15 months from account opening on purchases and balance transfers, then a variable APR of 18.24% - 27.74% Ability to pool rewards with other Chase cards 0% Intro APR for 15 months from account opening on purchases and balance transfers, then a variable APR of 18.24% - 27.74% Ability to pool rewards with other Chase cards Travel and Purchase Coverage Auto rental coverage Purchase protection Extended warranty coverage Travel and emergency assistance Auto rental coverage Purchase protection Extended warranty coverage Travel and emergency assistance Cell phone protection (through September 20, 2026) Annual Fee $0 $0 The Freedom Unlimited card and Freedom Flex card are similar except for their bonus categories. That’s why they pair so well with the Chase Sapphire Preferred card. With the Freedom Unlimited card, you can earn 3% for drugstore purchases and use it as a catchall to earn 1.5% on purchases that would otherwise only earn 1% on the Chase Sapphire Preferred card. The Freedom Flex card earns 5% on quarterly rotating bonus categories on up to $1,500, with common categories including grocery stores, gas stations, Target, and Walmart. I combine the earnings across these 3 cards to get an earning stack that maximizes my rewards: 5x points on Chase Travel purchases 5% cash-back on Freedom Flex quarterly rotating bonus categories up to the $1,500 quarterly limit 3x points on dining, online grocery purchases (excluding Walmart, Target, and wholesale clubs), gas, EV charging, vacation homes (such as Airbnb and Vrbo), and qualifying streaming services 3% cash-back at drugstores 2x points on all other travel 1.5% cash-back on all other purchases Hot Tip: Even though the Freedom Unlimited card and the Freedom Flex card are marketed as cash-back cards, they still earn Chase Ultimate Rewards points, which can be pooled with Chase Sapphire Preferred card points. That means when you have all the cards, the cash-back rates above can become, in effect, points rates. Best Business Cards To Pair With the Chase Sapphire Preferred Card Chase offers a couple of business cards that can make great companions to the Chase Sapphire Preferred card — the Ink Business Unlimited® Credit Card and the Ink Business Cash® Credit Card . Pool points on personal and business purchases. Image Credit: Upgraded Points LLC Here’s a look at the key details of these 2 business cards: SCROLL FOR MORE Card Feature Ink Business Unlimited Card Ink Business Cash Card Welcome Offer Earn $750 $1,000 bonus cash-back after you spend $8,000 on purchases in the first 4 months from account opening. Earn $750 $1,000 when you spend $8,000 on purchases in the first 4 months after account opening. Earning Rates 1.5% back on all purchases 5% back in combined purchases at office supply stores, cellular phone, landline, internet, and cable TV services each account anniversary year (on up to $25,000 spent) 2% back in combined dining and gas purchases annually (on up to $25,000 spent) 1% back on all other purchases Card Benefits 0% intro APR on purchases for 12 months; variable 16.74% - 24.74% thereafter. 0% intro APR on purchases for 12 months; 16.74% - 24.74% variable thereafter. Travel and Purchase Coverages Auto rental coverage Purchase protection Extended warranty coverage Travel and emergency assistance Roadside assistance Annual fee $0 By pairing these business cards with the Chase Sapphire Preferred card, you can earn rewards on business transactions and pool them with Chase Sapphire Preferred card points. Here is what my combined earning rates look like with this 3-card strategy: 5x points on Chase Travel purchases, and 5% on combined purchases at office supply stores, cellular phone, landline, internet, and cable TV services each account anniversary year (on up to $25,000 spent) 3x points on dining, online grocery purchases (excluding Walmart, Target, and wholesale clubs), gas, EV charging, vacation homes (such as Airbnb and Vrbo), and some streaming services 2x points on all other travel 1.5% on all other purchases Plus, just like the personal card setup, this combined 3-card combo still keeps the total annual fees you pay under $100, and the cash-back earnings on your business cards can be combined with the points on your Chase Sapphire Preferred card. Final Thoughts The Chase Sapphire Preferred card can offer even more value when you pair it alongside other top Chase cards, and implementing this strategy isn’t expensive. The Chase trifecta — whether involving personal or business products — keeps your collective annual fees under $100.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Delta’s Beyond the Summer Promotion Offers Discounts, Bonus Miles, and More\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/delta-beyond-the-summer-promotion-2026/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/Delta-Air-Lines-B737-900ER-Atlanta-Renaissance-Marriott.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:30:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Even though the end of summer is already in sight, Delta wants to keep the fun going with the return of its Beyond the Summer promotion, through which customers can score flight deals, earn bonus miles, and more. Let’s dive into everything you need to know about this exciting promo. Delta’s Beyond the Summer Promo — The Details Delta’s Beyond the Summer promo gives Delta SkyMiles members the chance to score flight deals, limited-time offers, and double miles for eligible members. Earn Double Miles on Some Delta Flights If you book a qualifying Delta Main Classic or Main Extra flight between now and July 23, 2026, you can earn double SkyMiles when booking routes included in the promotion . Featured destinations include Auckland (AKL), New Zealand; Frankfurt (FRA), Germany; Hong Kong (HKG); Honolulu (HNL); Paris (CDG); Punta Cana (PUJ), Dominican Republic; Riyadh (RUH), Saudi Arabia; Rome (FCO); Seoul (ICN), South Korea; Shanghai (PVG), China; Sydney (SYD), and more. Save on Vacation Packages and Earn Bonus Miles on Stays, Cruises, and Car Rentals Now through August 6, 2026, SkyMiles members can save up to $275 on a vacation package that includes a flight and hotel . Remember, Delta Vacations purchases earn redeemable SkyMiles and Medallion Qualification Dollars (MQDs). If you need a place to stay, you can earn 4x miles on eligible hotel bookings through Delta Stays , and also unlock access to VIP Access Benefits, which can get you room upgrades and food and beverage credits at some properties. Alternatively, earn 3x miles in addition to a 2,000-mile bonus after completing a qualifying Airbnb Experience or Service that costs at least $50 when you book by August 6, 2026, and complete by March 31, 2027. SkyMiles members can also earn at higher rates on eligible car rentals booked by August 6 through Delta Cars: Earn up to 16x miles at Hertz , depending on your Medallion status level. Earn 8x miles at Dollar and Thrifty. Earn 4x miles at Alamo, Avis, Budget, Enterprise, Payless, and SIXT. If a cruise vacation is on your list, you can earn up to 4x miles when you book through Delta Cruises . You’ll earn 3x miles on interior and oceanview staterooms and 4x miles on balcony staterooms and suites. This offer is valid through August 6. Earn bonus miles when you book a sailing through Delta Cruises. Image Credit: Ryan Smith Delta gift card purchases of at least $300 also earn miles at higher rates through August 6: General SkyMiles members earn 2x miles. Silver Medallion members earn 3x miles. Gold Medallion members earn 4x miles. Platinum and Diamond Medallion members earn 5x miles . Finally, you can earn up to 2,000 bonus miles when making purchases through the SkyMiles Shopping portal at more than 1,000 retailers through August 10, 2026. Hot Tip: Want to learn more? Read about all the best ways to earn and redeem SkyMiles for maximum value . Final Thoughts Delta’s Beyond the Summer promotion provides multiple ways to score discounts or earn bonus miles on a wide range of purchases. If you have travel to book, be sure to check out the deals featured in this promotion before you do.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://feeds.content.dowjones.io/public/rss/RSSMarketsMain\",\"feedTitle\":\"WSJ.com: Markets\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=wsj.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"WSJ Dollar Index Rises 0.18% to 97.34\",\"link\":\"https://www.wsj.com/finance/currencies/new-trump-tariffs-threaten-to-further-strain-cad-3b0f1e73?mod=rss_markets_main\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wsj.com%2Ffinance%2Fcurrencies%2Fnew-trump-tariffs-threaten-to-further-strain-cad-3b0f1e73%3Fmod%3Drss_markets_main&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dwsj.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:29:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The WSJ Dollar Index rose 0.2% — up for four consecutive trading days.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"The Switch 2 is $50 off at Woot for new customers\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/968325/woot-switch-2-coupon-discount-code-deal-sale\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/12/Nintendo-Switch-2.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-21T13:27:32.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Games look gorgeous on its 7.9-inch screen. | Photo: Brandt Ranj / The Verge Woot is celebrating its 22nd anniversary by rolling out a full week of sales, and one of them stands out for gamers looking to get a deal on Nintendo’s latest console. Normally $449.99, the Nintendo Switch 2 is $22 off for Woot customers who already have an account, or $50 off for new customers, when you use coupon code GIFT26 at checkout. Nintendo Switch 2 Where to Buy: $449.99 $428.99 at Woot (with 