z=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Show HN: Immersive Gaussian Splat tour of grace cathedral, San Francisco\",\"link\":\"https://vincentwoo.com/3d/grace_cathedral/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvincentwoo.com%2F3d%2Fgrace_cathedral%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dnews.ycombinator.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T20:10:44.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Comments\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Get Borderlands 3, Risk of Rain 2 and 13 other great PC games for $15\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/968191/humble-2k-megahits-bundle-xcom-borderlands-duke-nukem-deal-sale\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/chorus/uploads/chorus_asset/file/18971331/BL3_FL4K_Skag.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T20:08:51.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Borderlands 3 is among the 15 games in the 2K Megahits 2026 Bundle. | 2K Games The aptly-named “2K Megahits 2026 Bundle” from Humble includes 15 Steam games for $15. It’s a smattering of the publisher 2K’s biggest games of the 2010s, including BioShock Infinite, Risk of Rain 2, Borderlands 3, and XCOM: Enemy Unknown . The bundle will be available until August 7th, though the bundle page notes that keys for some games are already starting to run low. All of the games work on Windows, while some support MacOS and SteamOS. 2K Megahits 2026 Bundle Where to Buy: $465 $15 at Humble One of my personal favorite games, Risk of Rain 2 , is included in the bundle. In the third-person roguelike, you’ll face off against increasingly difficult waves of enemies, fighting to stay alive as long as you can and collecting power-ups and useful perks before extracting to the next zone to do it all again. It’s just challenging enough to make victory satisfying, and fun to play alone or with friends. You also get 2012’s XCOM: Enemy Unknown , a legendary turn-based strategy game that’s usually $15 on its own, to give you a sense of the bundle’s value. The bundle also notably includes three games from the Borderlands universe. Borderlands 3 Special Edition is a traditional looter-shooter FPS, Tiny Tina’s Wonderlands adds RPG elements like an overworld map and spellcasting, and Tales from the Borderlands is an interactive episodic visual novel from Telltale Games. You’ll also get a variety of shooters, including BioShock Infinite, Duke Nukem 3D, Bulletstorm , plus Hidden and Dangerous from the turn of the millenium . Part of the proceeds from the bundle benefit Covenant House , an organization that benefits young people facing homelessness, as well as the publisher and Humble. You can adjust how you pledge is split between the beneficiaries by clicking the button that says “adjust donation” under the checkout button. You can find the full list of games in the bundle below: Risk of Rain 2 Borderlands 3 Standard Edition Mafia II: Definitive Edition BioShock Infinite Tiny Tina’s Wonderlands The Quarry Tribes of Midgard Deluxe Edition Homeworld Remastered Collection Tales from the Borderlands Bulletstorm Full Clip Edition Duke Nukem 3D: 20th Anniversary World Tour Hidden and Dangerous Bundle The Darkness II X-COM: UFO Defense XCOM Enemy Unknown\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Hacker News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=news.ycombinator.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"The Power of Awareness: Overcoming Surveillance Capitalism\",\"link\":\"https://www.scottrlarson.com/presentations/overcoming-surveillance-capitalism-with-awareness/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.scottrlarson.com%2Fpresentations%2Fovercoming-surveillance-c