tric truck, engineered for efficiency and also — perhaps most importantly — profitability. The truck will be revealed in 2027, but Ford plans on building a whole family of low-cost electric vehicles at its Kentucky assembly plant. The heavily camouflaged truck has already been spotted out in the wild, with observers noting that it seems even smaller than the Maverick. Success isn’t guaranteed. Ford has struggled to make profitable EVs, forcing the company to take a staggering $19.5 billion hit on its EV investments in 2025. But Ford still sees EVs as the future — just not oversize ones with “no path to profitability,” as executives say. Emojis as camouflage. Ford’s $30K electric truck could be smaller than a Maverick. Inside the lab where Ford is trying to crack the code on cheap EVs Ford’s EV and software chief Doug Field is leaving the company Ford is fighting against physics to build affordable EVs Ford’s big bet on EVs didn’t pan out — now it’s pivoting to hybrids and energy storage Ford CEO Jim Farley on China, tariffs, and the quest for a $30,000 EV Ford reveals breakthrough process for lower priced EVs\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"The wireless headset that gets hot-swappable batteries right\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/967153/glorious-infiniteplay-wireless-gaming-headset-hands-on\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/07/268648_Glorious_GHS_InfinitePlay_headset_CFaulkner_0013.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T19:18:16.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"New gaming gear is always promising to shave milliseconds off latency or response time. The improvements usually aren't obvious. But the Glorious GHS InfinitePlay wireless headset, on the other hand, could save you far more than just milliseconds: It has the fastest hot-swap battery system I've ever used, and the headset doesn't die when you swap out its battery either. Glorious improves on the formula popularized by SteelSeries , which made swappable, rechargeable batteries a feature worth caring about in a high-end headset. Its new $229.99 headset has zero audio downtime while swapping batteries because it has a fallback battery that can … Read the full story at The Verge.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/chuyen-tro-linh-tinh-tm.17/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Chuyện trò linh tinh™\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Làm sao để thay đổi được cách ăn mặc của vợ?\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/lam-sao-de-thay-doi-duoc-cach-an-mac-cua-vo.219484/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Flam-sao-de-thay-doi-duoc-cach-an-mac-cua-vo.219484&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T19:17:14.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2021-01-23T20:49:42+0700\",\"content\":\"Vợ em ăn mặc giản dị quá các bác ạ, nếu nói nặng hơn tí là hơi quê. Vợ em xuất thân từ quê, nên ăn mặc giản dị nó ăn sâu vào máu rồi. Lúc yêu em cũng không chê trách phàn nàn gì vì em là người dễ tính (CHính em cũng ăn mặc giản dị dễ tính như thế). Nhưng hiện tại vợ em cũng đi làm rồi, công việc phải giao tiếp nhiều với khách, thì vấn đề bây giờ mới phát sinh, vợ em bị anh xếp chê là mặt trẻ mà ăn mặc thì già, nên khó làm được việc. Mà vợ em thì bướng lắm, hàng tháng đưa lương em cũng bảo vợ... Read more\",\"replyCount\":94,\"viewCount\":15000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/tag/etf-portfolio-strategy.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"ETFs & Portfolio Strategy Articles on Seeking Alpha\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=seekingalpha.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"JEPQ: There's A