29.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"There are a ton of deals available to shop today thanks to Best Buy’s “Black Friday in July” sale lasting all week. The sale typically aligns closely with Prime Day each year, but of course, Amazon’s shopping holiday happened much earlier than we expected. So it’s nice to have some deals in July. One of example of a great deal is Apple’s AirPods Max 2 , which are down to $449 at Amazon and Best Buy , $100 off their usual price. It’s only the second time they’ve been discounted. Prime Day knocked them all the way down to $399.99, but today’s price isn’t bad at all if you missed out last month. They’re available at this price in every color. Apple AirPods Max (second-gen) Where to Buy: $549 $449 at Amazon $549 $449 at Best Buy Our review called the Max 2 a “great sequel, but not an ambitious one.” In short, not much has changed, especially in terms of design. There are some internal improvements that might make it worth it for those who have the original iteration (especially if you have the model with the Lightning connector). The Max 2 features USB-C connectivity like the 2024 revision, but has a built-in amp that delivers incredible sound that edges out the competition, not to mention the H2 wireless chip that enables features like live translation, adaptive audio, and conversation awareness. Some other great Verge-approved deals The Logitech G Pro X2 Superstrike wireless gaming mouse is a fascinating PC gaming accessory. Instead of having physical switches under its two main mouse buttons, it uses haptic motors to simulate the click sensation. The company made the switch to decrease latency, and to let you customize how much of a jolt each click delivers. If that sounds interesting to you, read our coverage , and consider picking it up at its first-ever discount at Amazon . The $179.99 mouse is down to $125.99, a temporary price cut that’ll be reflected at the checkout screen. Some other great Apple deals switched on overnight, including a four-pack of AirTags (second-gen) Bluetooth trackers . Originally $99.99, the four-pack is down to $89.99 at Amazon and Best Buy . Costco members can get an even better deal with five second-gen AirTags for $99.99. The latest AirTags’ biggest features include a louder alarm and extended range, which could give you a better chance at finding your lost items compared to the first-gen version, even if it’s four floors below (something the original AirTag couldn’t reliably do). Read Victoria Song’s review . Kodak’s Charmera isn’t a great camera. Let’s get that out of the way first. However, the name is on point — it’s charming as heck. The quality of the photos isn’t what you should buy it for. It’s just fun to have a flash-ready, screen-equipped digital camera connected to your keychain. Each Charmera comes in a blind box, so you won’t know which design you’ll get until you open it. If that sounds thrilling, you can try it out yourself with a good discount from Best Buy , where it costs $33.49 through the day (originally $49.99).\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://news.ycombinator.com/rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Hacker News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=news.ycombinator.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Controlling Reasoning Effort in LLMs\",\"link\":\"https://magazine.sebastianraschka.com/p/controlling-reasoning-effort-in-llms\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmagazine.sebastianraschka.com%2Fp%2Fcontrolling-reasoning-effort-in-llms&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dnews.ycombinator.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:35:19.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Comments\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://feeds.content.dowjones.io/public/rss/RSSMarketsMain\",\"feedTitle\":\"WSJ.com: Markets\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=wsj.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"U.S. Leading Indicators Ticked Down in June\",\"link\":\"https://www.wsj.com/economy/central-banking/u-s-leading-indicators-ticked-down-in-june-546daa61?mod=rss_markets_main\",\"image\":\"https://images.wsj.net/im-75789667\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:32:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Daniel Heuer/Bloomberg News\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://tinhte.vn/rss/\",\"feedTitle\":\"Trang chủ\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=tinhte.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Trải nghiệm phim cách nhiệt Super Hi-Kool Beyond Ceramic: Lựa chọn tốt trong tầm giá\",\"link\":\"https://tinhte.vn/thread/trai-nghiem-phim-cach-nhiet-super-hi-kool-beyond-ceramic-lua-chon-tot-trong-tam-gia.4142988/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftinhte.vn%2Fthread%2Ftrai-nghiem-phim-cach-nhiet-super-hi-kool-beyond-ceramic-lua-chon-tot-trong-tam-gia.4142988%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dtinhte.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:30:14.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Phim cách nhiệt Ceramic hiện đang là dòng phim được đa số người tiêu dùng tại Việt Nam lựa chọn nhờ độ bền bỉ cùng hiệu quả cản tia hồng ngoại vượt trội. Tuy nhiên, nhược điểm cố hữu của chất liệu gốm là khả năng tích tụ nhiệt cao trên bề mặt. Khi xe di chuyển lâu dưới nắng, tấm kính vô tình trở thành một nguồn phát nhiệt, phả hơi nóng làm hai người ngồi hàng ghế trước cảm thấy ngột ngạt, khó chịu. Để giải quyết bài toán nan giải này, mỗi thương hiệu đều phát triển những công nghệ cốt lõi... Trải nghiệm phim cách nhiệt Super Hi-Kool Beyond Ceramic: Lựa chọn tốt trong tầm giá\",\"replyCount\":5,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100727362\",\"feedTitle\":\"International: Top News And Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"JPMorgan likes this missile and aircraft systems maker. Here's why\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/20/jpmorgan-likes-this-missile-and-aircraft-systems-maker-heres-why.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F20%2Fjpmorgan-likes-this-missile-and-aircraft-systems-maker-heres-why.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:30:01.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Moog is already up 61% in 2026, but it could see its stock trade even higher as its business gains more momentum across several industries, per JPMorgan.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Earn 100 Marriott Bonus Points on Starbucks Purchases This Week\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/marriott-bonvoy-starbucks-promotion/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Starbucks-Drive-Through-Sign-Upgraded-Points-LLC-2.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:27:16.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"If you’re visiting Starbucks this week, a joint promotion with Marriott Bonvoy has you in mind. Thanks to this new offer for Marriott Bonvoy Week , you can earn 100 bonus Marriott Bonvoy points on Starbucks purchases this week. That’s not as good as the 300 and 500 points offered in other versions of this promotion. How does it work? Let’s check it out. Starbucks Promotion for Marriott Bonvoy Week — Details The Starbucks and Marriott partnership isn’t new, and linking your Starbucks Rewards account with your Marriott Bonvoy account can earn double stars when staying at Marriott properties. There’s also the promise of exclusive experiences. However, a promotion during Marriott Bonvoy Week provides 100 bonus points after making 3 Starbucks transactions from July 20 to 26, 2026 , at Starbucks locations in the U.S. These joint Marriott-Starbucks offers began in 2024, and promotions range from 100 to 500 bonus points. We’ve seen far more of the 100-point offers than anything else recently. Image Credit: Marriott Currently, this promotion is offered in the third week of every month. The next offer will be available the week of August 17, 2026. Qualifying transactions must be at least $2 each. Additionally, gift cards and alcohol purchases don’t count. Qualifying purchases are those made through the mobile app or Starbucks website using a linked payment method or a preloaded Starbucks card. Alternatively, scan the barcode associated with your Starbucks Rewards account when it’s time to pay. You can only earn 100 bonus points a single time this week. Since we value Marriott Bonvoy points at 0.7 cents each, that means 100 bonus points are worth $0.70. Hot Tip: Besides buying Starbucks, Marriott Bonvoy points are incredibly easy to earn. Check out our guide on the best ways to earn lots of Marriott Bonvoy points ! Is It Worth It? Should you go out of your way for $0.70 worth of Marriott Bonvoy points? No. If you’re already ordering Starbucks at least 3 times this week, then this can be a nice addition. Alternatively, if you’re ordering multiple items during a single visit, it may be worth splitting those into separate transactions. If you pay for 3 items in separate transactions, this should trigger the bonus offer, assuming each item costs at least $2. But what if you don’t normally buy from Starbucks? This deal is unlikely to sway customers. Compare the cost of purchasing from Starbucks against your other options if you’re simply looking for a cup of coffee. Additionally, this isn’t the only method for coffee-based rewards. You can earn from a Delta-Starbucks partnership when flying with Delta Air Lines or get up to $7 in monthly credits for purchases with Dunkin’ if you enroll for a benefit on the American Express® Gold Card . You’ve got options, so consider those before deciding on your purchase and which program you want to earn with. Final Thoughts This week, you can earn 100 bonus Marriott Bonvoy points by making 3 separate Starbucks purchases of $2 or more. It’s not a ton of value, so this promotion is best-suited for those buying from Starbucks already.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/chuyen-tro-linh-tinh-tm.17/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Chuyện trò linh tinh™\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"(có hình) đau quá các bác, lấy cao răng ở rhm tw hà nội\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/co-hinh-dau-qua-cac-bac-lay-cao-rang-o-rhm-tw-ha-noi.1249768/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fco-hinh-dau-qua-cac-bac-lay-cao-rang-o-rhm-tw-ha-noi.1249768&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-20T14:26:37.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-06-11T13:16:19+0700\",\"content\":\"hôm nay đúng là cơn ác mộng với em nghe review đã lâu, nên sáng em đi lấy cao răng ở bv rhm tw tiền khám 50.600đ, tiền lấy cao răng 350k, rồi lên phòng nha chu ở tầng ba khi lấy, buốt, xót kinh khủng, cảm giác cái lấy cao răng nó ấn xuống hết phần dưới lợi, sâu xuống phần dưới lợi luôn ấy các bác cảm giác lợi bị tách ra, rồi dụng cụ chọc sâu xuống dưới lợi 20p làm là 20p đau k chịu nổi khi lấy xong, em đi về, ra soi cam đt thì thấy chảy đầy máu, lúc súc miệng để đánh bóng thì cũng toàn... Read more\",\"replyCount\":71,\"viewCount\":7000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Man with airsoft rifles caused fireworks explosion outside NYC immigration court: MS NOW\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/20/new-york-nyc-fbi-incendi