lta Platinum card , providing an opportunity to upgrade to the Delta Reserve card and earn 15,000 SkyMiles after spending $500 within 6 months . The Delta Reserve card charges a $650 annual fee ( rates & fees ). Still, it comes with perks not available on the Delta Platinum card or the Delta Gold card, including 15 Visits to the Delta Sky Club per Medallion Year when flying same-day with Delta, free checked bags, enhanced companion certificates on select fare classes, guest passes for Sky Club lounges annually, and priority boarding. The Delta Reserve card is the most premium Delta co-branded card available. Image Credit: Upgraded Points LLC Since this is an upgrade offer, your existing account history and credit line remain intact , making it an option to consider without opening an entirely new card. Is It Worth It? For frequent Delta flyers, the Delta Reserve card can be a strong option. It helps you qualify or re-qualify for higher Delta elite status and comes with perks such as Delta Sky Club and Amex Centurion Lounge access (when flying Delta that day), complimentary checked bags, complimentary upgrades upon availability, and an annual companion certificate . Cardmembers receive 15 Sky Club visits per year, with unlimited access after $75,000 in spending per calendar year, plus 4 one-time guest passes annually. As of July 8, 2026, cardmember guests must also be flying on the same flight as the cardmember to gain access to all U.S. Centurion lounge locations, plus select international locations. We value Delta SkyMiles at 1.2 cents per mile; therefore, this upgrade offer of 15,000 bonus SkyMiles is worth roughly $180 . That said, we’ve previously seen upgrade offers of up to 35,000 bonus SkyMiles but with a higher spend requirement, so if you’re not in a rush, it might be worth waiting for that offer to come back around. Between the bonus, statement credit, and ongoing Delta Reserve card perks, this upgrade can deliver real value for those who fly Delta regularly. Hot Tip: If you’re trying to decide if upgrading to the Delta Reserve card is worth it, check out our benefits guide for the card to determine if it’s worth it for you. Final Thoughts The targeted upgrade to the Delta Reserve card can provide solid value for eligible Delta Platinum cardholders. With 15,000 bonus miles and perks like Sky Club access, free checked bags, and priority boarding, it’s worth checking if the offer fits your travel goals.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Về sớm để kịp đưa tang hàng xóm, đoàn xe du lịch gặp nạn 4 người tử vong\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/ve-som-de-kip-dua-tang-hang-xom-doan-xe-du-lich-gap-nan-4-nguoi-tu-vong.1261341/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fve-som-de-kip-dua-tang-hang-xom-doan-xe-du-lich-gap-nan-4-nguoi-tu-vong.1261341&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-19T17:57:56.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-17T12:47:22+0700\",\"content\":\"Về sớm để kịp đưa tang hàng xóm, đoàn xe du lịch gặp nạn 4 người tử vong (Dân trí) - Nghe tin hàng xóm qua đời, đoàn du lịch của bà Thịnh (ở Thái Nguyên) quyết định về sớm hơn dự định để kịp đưa tang, không ngờ trên đường gặp nạn, 4 người tử vong. dantri.com.vn (Dân trí) - Nghe tin hàng xóm qua đời, đoàn du lịch của bà Thịnh (ở Thái Nguyên) quyết định về sớm hơn dự định để kịp đưa tang, không ngờ trên đường gặp nạn, 4 người tử vong.​ Thay đổi lịch về để kịp dự đám tang hàng xóm​ Tỉnh dậy tại Bệnh viện Đa khoa Thường Tín, cơ thể bà Nguyễn Thị Thịnh đau nhức. Thoát chết trong vụ lật xe khách chở đoàn du... Click to expand... Read more\",\"replyCount\":174,\"viewCount\":20000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/tag/etf-portfolio-strategy.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"ETFs & Portfolio Strategy Arti