e-keep-september-option-open\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bloomberg.com%2Fnews%2Farticles%2F2026-07-18%2Fecb-expected-to-skip-rate-hike-keep-september-option-open&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dfeeds.bloomberg.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T20:00:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The European Central Bank is likely to hold off on a second interest-rate hike in the coming week while keeping that option open for September.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Lãi suất tăng cao, thanh khoản bất động sản giảm 62%\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/lai-suat-tang-cao-thanh-khoan-bat-dong-san-giam-62.1260264/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Flai-suat-tang-cao-thanh-khoan-bat-dong-san-giam-62.1260264&rss=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn2.tuoitre.vn%2Fthumb_w%2F730%2F471584752817336320%2F2026%2F7%2F13%2Fbase64-1783936807133443049086.jpeg&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T19:43:35.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-13T18:31:14+0700\",\"content\":\"Lãi suất thả nổi tại nhiều ngân hàng đã chạm ngưỡng 15 - 16%/năm khiến người mua nhà \\\"chùn tay\\\". Hệ quả là tổng lượng hấp thụ bất động sản sơ cấp trong 6 tháng đầu năm 2026 đã giảm tới 62% so với nửa cuối năm 2025. Lãi suất vay mua nhà 6 tháng đầu năm duy trì mức cao khiến tổng lượng hấp thụ bất động sản sơ cấp trong 6 tháng đầu năm 2026 đã sụt giảm mạnh tới 62% so với nửa... Click to expand... Read more\",\"replyCount\":20,\"viewCount\":3000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Taylor Farms recalls iceberg lettuce in 27 states due to cyclosporiasis outbreak\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/18/taylor-farms-recalls-iceberg-lettuce-in-27-states-due-to-cyclosporiasis-outbreak.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F18%2Ftaylor-farms-recalls-iceberg-lettuce-in-27-states-due-to-cyclosporiasis-outbreak.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T19:35:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Taylor Farms is recalling iceberg lettuce in 27 states because of the potential that the greens could be contaminated with cyclosporiasis.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Uzbekistan Gets a Hyatt, Hilton’s First LXR Resort in Hawaiʻi, W Arrives in Saudi Arabia, and More Hotel News\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/hotel-news-roundup-july-week-3-2026/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Ka-Lai-Waikiki-Beach-LXR-Hotels-Resorts-Property-View.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T19:26:36.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"A busy week of hotel news brought major luxury openings in Hawaiʻi, Uzbekistan, England, and Saudi Arabia, along with future projects from Regent and Six Senses. Hilton also expanded its ResortPass partnership, giving travelers and locals more ways to enjoy hotel pools, spas, and resort amenities without booking an overnight stay. Here’s a summary of the hotel industry news you may have missed. Hotel Openings Ka Laʻi Waikīkī Beach, LXR Hotels & Resorts Hilton has completed a $100 million transformation of Ka Laʻi Waikīkī Beach, marking the first LXR Hotels & Resorts property in Hawaiʻi. The reimagined resort features 238 residential-style studios and suites, refreshed public spaces, locally inspired artwork, and 3 new dining concepts . These include the Pacific Rim-focused Kini Room, the cocktail-driven Muse Lounge, and Bloom Cafe & Restaurant, which serves breakfast overlooking Waikīkī. Image Credit: Hilton Prices start at $509 or 100,000  Hilton Honors  points per night. Beldersoy Resort & Spa, Destination by Hyatt Hyatt has opened its first Destination by Hyatt property in Uzbekistan , marking the country’s first premium mountain resort. Located in the Beldersoy mountains near Tashkent, the resort has 109 rooms and 36 private villas, all with mountain views . Guests have direct access to ski slopes, hiking, and biking trails, while the wellness facilities include indoor and outdoor pools, a mineral-enriched seawater pool, a floating pool, and an infinity pool overlooking the mountains. Image Credit: Hyatt Nights start at $300 or 8,000  World of Hyatt  points for this Category 3 property. Fairmont Cheshire, The Mere Fairmont has opened its fifth property in the U.K. and Ireland following a major renovation of The Mere , a countryside resort set on a 157-acre estate outside Manchester. The property now has 116 rooms, including 23 suites, along with a 1,715-square-meter spa, a 20-meter indoor pool, and a new Gordon Ramsay restaurant . Image Credit: Fairmont Nights start at $265, and you can redeem ALL – Accor Live Limitless toward your stay: 1,000 points are worth €20 ($22.88). W Riyadh – KAFD Marriott has opened the first W hotel in Saudi Arabia in Riyadh’s King Abdullah Financial District. The 210-room W Riyadh – KAFD includes 17 suites, 2 penthouse suites, and a massive W Penthouse with 2 bedrooms, a kitchenette, an office, and private fitness and spa facilities . The property also features several dining venues, an outdoor WET Deck, an AWAY Spa, and 15 meeting rooms. Image Credit: Marriott Nights start at $315 or 44,000 Marriott Bonvoy points. Liberté 33, Ascend Collection Choice Hotels has opened Liberté 33 in Poznań, Poland, expanding its Ascend Collection portfolio in Europe. Located near the city’s Old Town, the boutique hotel occupies a restored historic villa and a contemporary annex. Amenities include a restaurant and bar, wellness facilities, a fitness center, and flexible meeting and event spaces. Image Credit: Choice Hotels Rooms start at $74 or 15,000 Choice Privileges points. Future Hotel Announcements Regent Chengdu (2029) IHG will bring its ultra-luxury Regent brand to Chengdu in the third quarter of 2029. The 180-room hotel will occupy floors 39 through 48 of a 233-meter tower in the city’s Jinjiang District . Plans call for panoramic skyline and river views, signature restaurants, a spa, and Regent’s personalized Experience Agent service. Six Senses AMAALA (2026) Set to open later this month, Six Senses AMAALA will debut along Saudi Arabia’s Red Sea coast as one of the region’s most anticipated luxury resorts. The property will feature 100 suites and villas, 25 branded residences, 3 restaurants, a cooking school, and an extensive wellness complex . The Shepherd Mayfair (2026) The Shepherd Mayfair is scheduled to open in London on September 1, 2026 . The 82-room boutique hotel occupies the site of Mayfair’s oldest known house and will include 3 dining and drinking venues: Fayre, The Lounge, and a late-night cocktail bar called Teddy’s. Other Industry News Hilton expands ResortPass partnership: Hilton has extended its partnership with ResortPass for another 3 years, expanding day-pass access to resort amenities across the Americas. Ritz-Carlton partners with MERIT Beauty: The Ritz-Carlton has teamed up with MERIT Beauty to offer exclusive in-room amenities, Club Lounge products, and limited-edition travel sets at select North American hotels. Final Thoughts Luxury hotels dominated this week’s headlines, from Hyatt’s debut in Uzbekistan and Hilton’s first LXR resort in Hawaiʻi to W’s arrival in Saudi Arabia. Travelers can also look forward to several high-end openings and enjoy Hilton resorts in new ways with ResortPass.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/diem-bao.33/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Điểm báo\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Chính thức: Quán Internet mở cửa sau 22h bị phạt đến 15 triệu đồng\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/chinh-thuc-quan-internet-mo-cua-sau-22h-bi-phat-den-15-trieu-dong.1256708/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fchinh-thuc-quan-internet-mo-cua-sau-22h-bi-phat-den-15-trieu-dong.1256708&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T18:30:36.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-02T09:48:35+0700\",\"content\":\"ANTD.VN - Theo quy định mới, từ đầu tháng 7-2026, quán Internet mở cửa sau 22h bị phạt đến 15 triệu đồng; gửi email che giấu danh tính bị phạt đến 70 triệu đồng. Nghị định 174/2026/NĐ-CP xử phạt vi phạm hành chính bưu chính, viễn thông, công nghệ thông tin có hiệu lực thi hành từ đầu tháng 7/2026 quy định rõ mức phạt đối với hành vi vi phạm quy định về điểm cung cấp dịch vụ trò chơi điện tử công cộng. Theo đó, phạt tiền từ 10 - 15 triệu đồng đối với một trong các hành vi: Thiết lập... Click to expand... Read more\",\"replyCount\":296,\"viewCount\":27000},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Google might not kneecap the Pixel 11a with an old processor\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/tech/967612/google-pixel-11a-tensor-g6-leak\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/03/google-pixel-10a-7.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T18:25:08.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The Pixel 10a shipped with a last gen processor. | Photo: Dominic Preston / The