"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://genk.vn/rss/home.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Genk.vn\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=genk.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Kimi K3 của Trung Quốc bất ngờ tự nhận là Claude: Dấy lên nghi vấn được “chưng cất” từ AI của Anthropic\",\"link\":\"https://genk.vn/kimi-k3-cua-trung-quoc-bat-ngo-tu-nhan-la-claude-day-len-nghi-van-duoc-chung-cat-tu-ai-cua-anthropic-165261807082515065.chn\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgenk.vn%2Fkimi-k3-cua-trung-quoc-bat-ngo-tu-nhan-la-claude-day-len-nghi-van-duoc-chung-cat-tu-ai-cua-anthropic-165261807082515065.chn&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dgenk.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T04:00:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Kimi K3 đang gây sốt khi trở thành mô hình AI Trung Quốc dẫn đầu Frontend Code Arena. Nhưng ngay sau đó, mô hình này lại gây tranh cãi vì bất ngờ tự nhận mình là Claude của Anthropic.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/vietnamese/rss.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"BBC News Tiếng Việt\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=bbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"News\",\"title\":\"Vì sao một số phụ nữ nhìn thấy những màu sắc mà người khác không thể?\",\"link\":\"https://www.bbc.com/vietnamese/articles/c0eye2r45pyo?at_medium=RSS&amp%3Bat_campaign=rss\",\"image\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/ws/240/cpsprodpb/b18c/live/191a0c70-73ad-11f1-9da1-db101e3ae6ed.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T03:18:19.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Ước tính khoảng 12% phụ nữ mang một biến thể gen có thể giúp họ có khả năng nhìn màu vượt trội. Tuy nhiên, việc chứng minh chính xác họ nhìn thấy những gì là vô cùng khó khăn.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Snag MLB Field-Level Seats for Just 5,000 Capital One Miles — Here’s How\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/capital-one-miles-mlb-tickets/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Anaheim-Stadium-Field-Level.jpeg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T02:57:24.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"You may think of using your points and miles for travel, but there are numerous other ways to use them. For example, you can even redeem Capital One miles for baseball tickets. And while these redemptions don’t typically offer the best value for your miles, there is an exception: You can snag field-level baseball tickets for just 5,000 miles each through cardholder exclusives. Here’s how you can score these baseball tickets with your miles. How To Redeem Capital One Miles for Field-Level MLB Tickets You’ll find these tickets in the Capital One Entertainment portal , and you need to be logged in to check seats and pricing . From here, you can redeem Capital One miles for numerous tickets — some of which cost far less than 5,000 miles each. The best deal includes specially priced field-level tickets. These cardholder-exclusive tickets are typically available for the following 2 months , meaning availability right now is for games in August and September 2026. Tickets at these special prices can sell out quickly, as there are usually only 4 available at each game. Where are these seats located? They’re usually a few rows behind 1 of the 2 dugouts , though the exact location varies by stadium. For example, at the Astros’ stadium in Houston, Texas, you’ll find tickets in dugout 113, row 13. Location of the special 5,000-mile tickets. Image Credit: Capital One Entertainment You can choose your preferred team and view all available tickets here . Is It Worth It? We value Capital One miles at 1.8 cents apiece. Most redemptions in the Capital One Entertainment portal provide a value of 0.8 cents per mile — which is less than half of that number. Looking at the cash cost for Braves at Astros on September 19, 2026, highlighted above, tickets in the same section but a higher row are selling for $163 each. Redeeming 5,000 miles here provides a value of 3.26 cents per mile. That’s fantastic , but you’ll need to consider whether you’d get a better value using your miles for a great travel redemption. Hot Tip: Wondering what the best ways to redeem Capital One miles are? Our guide can show you numerous options for using miles at top value. Final Thoughts We typically recommend using your points and miles for travel, rather than suboptimal redemptions in entertainment portals. There is an exception, however, when you can use just 5,000 Capital One miles for MLB tickets to see your favorite team — or just redeem at a decent value for a fun family experience. If you’re in doubt, do the math to see what value you’re getting for your miles.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://genk.vn/rss/home.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Genk.vn\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=genk.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Apple tăng giá iCloud+ tại Việt Nam, gói 50 GB tăng mạnh nhất\",\"link\":\"https://genk.vn/apple-tang-gia-icloud-tai-viet-nam-goi-50-gb-tang-manh-nhat-165260718095114764.chn\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgenk.vn%2Fapple-tang-gia-icloud-tai-viet-nam-goi-50-gb-tang-manh-nhat-165260718095114764.chn&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dgenk.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-18T02:50:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Đây là lần đầu tiên Apple điều chỉnh giá iCloud+ tại Việt Nam kể từ giữa năm 2023, đồng thời nằm trong đợt tăng giá diễn ra tại 8 quốc gia trên thế giới.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://genk.vn/rss/home.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Genk.vn\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=genk.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Ra mắt máy tính bảng gaming màn