Penetration Assumptions Hit Fair Values, but Shares Still Look Cheap Our update on select stocks from the Telecom Services industry. Michael Hodel, CFA Jul 17, 2026\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.morningstar.com/topics/stocks\",\"feedTitle\":\"Morningstar\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.morningstar.com/favicon.ico\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"Novo Nordisk: EU Approval of Wegovy Pill Expands Opportunity, but Cash Pay Raises Systematic Risk Ka...\",\"link\":\"https://www.morningstar.com/stocks/novo-nordisk-eu-approval-wegovy-pill-expands-opportunity-cash-pay-raises-systematic-risk\",\"image\":\"https://media.morningstar.com/resizer/v2/DOLADMUV3BCTPOH2PPAQOLEVD4.jpg?auth=ad919c0fcf8d2ec41568519455b6de329bc15a253821b079cf2e7a359fd6c24d&quality=80&height=2400&width=2400&crop=525,0:1350,1350\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T19:04:48.152Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Novo Nordisk: EU Approval of Wegovy Pill Expands Opportunity, but Cash Pay Raises Systematic Risk Karen Andersen, CFA Jul 17, 2026\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"The Verge\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.theverge.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"GoPro’s discounted Max 2 bundle includes $100 worth of accessories\",\"link\":\"https://www.theverge.com/gadgets/967311/gopro-max2-360-degree-action-cam-accessory-bundle-deal-sale\",\"image\":\"https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2025/09/gopro_max2_2.jpg?quality=90&#038;strip=all&#038;crop=0,0,100,100\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T19:03:07.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The GoPro Max2 can use your earbuds as a microphone over Bluetooth. A 360-degree camera is a great way to ensure you capture every bit of the action, but prices tend to be on the high end for models worth your attention. That’s why it’s notable that the GoPro Max 2 accessory bundle is discounted to $369 at Amazon (a dollar more at Best Buy and GoPro ). The bundle is stuffed for being just $70 more than the base camera , containing everything you need to shoot the best angles during all-day adventures. The capable camera can shoot 360-degree 8K video at 30 frames per second, or 180-degree 4K video at 60FPS, and it can attach to the wide ecosystem of GoPro-compatible mounts. GoPro Max 2 Where to Buy: $569 $369 at Amazon (accessory bundle) $569 $369 at Best Buy (accessory bundle) In addition to the Max 2 camera, the bundle includes a four-foot extension pole, two protective lens caps, two high-capacity batteries, a 64GB microSD card, a curved adhesive mount, a mounting buckle for GoPro mounts, a mounting finger adapter for cameras, two thumb screws, a wrist lanyard, a microfiber cloth, and a USB-C cable. The standalone camera includes most of those accessories, but has fewer mounts, a single battery, no SD card, and no extension pole. The pole and extra battery are $75 on their own, so you’re getting a solid deal before you even take the free microSD card into account. The Max 2’s six-mic array records in every direction and automatically reduces wind noise. Alternatively, you can connect Bluetooth microphones, too. The 1.82-inch LCD touchscreen lets you quickly check your footage and manage settings, and it’s waterproof up to 16 feet in case you want to take it swimming or surfing. A single battery should last 66 minutes at full 8K, or 90 minutes at 5.6K resolution. The lenses are replaceable, too, in case a bad fall damages them. View this post on Instagram\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/market_overview.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Market Overview\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"US Housing Data Show Why the Construction Recovery Looks Uneven\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/us-housing-data-show-why-the-construction-rec