anel means you likely won’t have to manually recharge the battery, so long as it receives enough sunlight. You also get local and cloud video storage options, with the company offering three months of free cloud storage.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/tag/etf-portfolio-strategy.xml\",\"feedTitle\":\"ETFs & Portfolio Strategy Articles on Seeking Alpha\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=seekingalpha.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"BBN: The Backdrop Suggests It Will Push Higher From Here\",\"link\":\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4923099-bbn-the-backdrop-suggests-it-will-push-higher-from-here?source=feed_tag_etf_portfolio_strategy\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fseekingalpha.com%2Farticle%2F4923099-bbn-the-backdrop-suggests-it-will-push-higher-from-here%3Fsource%3Dfeed_tag_etf_portfolio_strategy&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dseekingalpha.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T18:02:37.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/286.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Most Popular Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"Gold Stocks Enter Their Strong Season at Deeply Oversold Levels\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/gold-stocks-enter-their-strong-season-at-deeply-oversold-levels-200684156\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fanalysis%2Fgold-stocks-enter-their-strong-season-at-deeply-oversold-levels-200684156&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dwww.investing.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T17:58:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"Targeted Marriott Promotion Offers 5K Bonus Bonvoy Points After Just 1 Stay\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/targeted-marriott-promotion-5k-bonus-points-1-stay/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2018/02/JW-Marriott-King-Bed-and-City-View.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T17:56:54.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"If you’re a member of both Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards, there’s a new targeted promotion worth checking. Not everyone will receive the offer, but eligible members who link their accounts through Your World Rewards and register can earn 5,000 bonus Marriott Bonvoy points after just 1 qualifying stay. Here’s what you need to know and how to see if you’re targeted to earn the bonus points. Earn 5,000 Bonus Bonvoy Points With an Eligible Marriott Stay The offer is available through Your World Rewards , the partnership between Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards . If you haven’t already, you’ll first need to link your Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards accounts . Then, if you’ve been targeted for the promotion, register and complete 1 eligible paid stay at a participating Marriott property by September 30, 2026, to earn a one-time bonus of 5,000 Marriott Bonvoy points . Image Credit: Marriott Here are some key terms to be aware of: You must register for the promotion and complete a qualifying stay by September 30, 2026. Must link your Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards accounts through Your World Rewards. Book directly with Marriott. Keep in mind that award stays, Cash + Points bookings, and reservations made through third-party sites like Expedia or Booking.com don’t qualify. Homes & Villas by Marriott Bonvoy, Marriott Executive Apartments, ExecuStay, and owner-occupied Marriott Vacation Club weeks are also excluded. If you meet the requirements, Marriott says the 5,000 bonus points should appear in your account within 2 to 4 weeks after the promotion ends. Is It Worth It? While 5,000 Marriott Bonvoy points won’t get you a free night at most properties, earning that bonus after just a 1-night stay is an easy win. If you’ve linked your Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards accounts through Your World Rewards and are targeted for the offer, there’s very little extra work required. We value Marriott Bonvoy points at 0.7 cents each , making this 5,000-point bonus worth about $35 toward future Marriott stays. Hot Tip: Already have your Marriott Bonvoy and Emirates Skywards accounts linked? Even if you weren’t targeted for this promotion, it’s worth keeping them connected. Your World Rewards lets eligible members earn Marriott Bonvoy points on qualifying Emirates flights and Emirates Skywards miles on eligible Marriott stays, and linking your accounts could help you qualify for future targeted offers. Final Thoughts This promotion won’t be available to everyone, but it’s an easy way to pick up some extra Bonvoy points if you were already planning a paid Marriott stay by September 30. It only takes a minute to check whether you’ve been targeted. If you have, registering before your next eligible stay could earn you an extra 5,000 points with very little effort.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=10001147\",\"feedTitle\":\"Business News\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"FAA lets Boeing sign off on 737 Max, 787 airworthiness certificates again\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/17/faa-boeing-737-max-787.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F17%2Ffaa-boeing-737-max-787.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T17:55:14.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The move is a vote of confi