ugust 8-November 18, 2026 Blackout date: September 7, 2026 Travel not valid on Friday or Sunday Continental U.S. to/from other destinations Travel August 11-November 18, 2026 Blackout dates: September 3-8, 2026 Travel on Sunday to Wednesday departing continental U.S. Travel on Tuesday to Friday on flights to the continental U.S. Travel to/from Puerto Rico is valid on Monday to Thursday Fares may vary by destination, flight, and day of the week and won’t be available on some flights that operate during very busy travel times and holiday periods. Fly all the way from Baltimore to Minneapolis for 7,000 points. Image Credit: Southwest Airlines Bookings are subject to these restrictions: Prices are available starting at a flat rate, which varies by flight destination. Discount is applied automatically without needing a promo code, but mandatory taxes and fees aren’t discounted. Not all flights are eligible for this promotion. Must book directly with Southwest to get the discount. Discount doesn’t apply to Cash + Points bookings. Discount doesn’t apply to the government taxes and fees assessed on each purchase. Fares are valid on nonstop flights only. Note that the points rebate won’t count toward A-List or A-List Preferred status , and this promotion only applies to new bookings. It’s worth noting that Southwest Rapid Rewards is a revenue-based rewards program, which means that award rates are aligned very closely with cash fares. All of this means that this promotion represents a fairly rare opportunity to redeem Rapid Rewards points at an outsized value. This could also be a great time to check your existing award bookings with Southwest . You can cancel and rebook them with the new, discounted rates if that would be cheaper than what you originally paid. Hot Tip: If you’re short on points to book an award flight with this promotion, you can quickly transfer points from Chase Ultimate Rewards and Bilt Rewards at a 1:1 ratio or transfer points from Marriott Bonvoy at a 3:1 ratio. Final Thoughts This is a great promotion for anyone with some Rapid Rewards points in their account. Since Southwest has a revenue-based award program, deals like this are rare and lucrative . If you have any potential Southwest travel in the near future, it could be worth booking flights now to take advantage of this deal, especially considering the fact that you can change or cancel flights later with no fees . If you’re going to book, remember to do so no later than July 20.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/commodities.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Commodities Analysis & Opinion\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"Gold Volatility Creates a High-Risk Range Between $3,950 and $4,100\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/gold-volatility-creates-a-highrisk-range-between-3950-and-4100-200684144\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fanalysis%2Fgold-volatility-creates-a-highrisk-range-between-3950-and-4100-200684144&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dwww.investing.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T15:03:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"California's billionaire tax: What's at risk for the biggest state economy in America\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/17/california-billionaire-tax.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F17%2Fcalifornia-billionaire-tax.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T15:02:57.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"c