ww.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"[Award Alert] Business Class From the U.S. to Australia From 93.5K Miles\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/award-alert-us-to-australia-business-class/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/American-Airlines-Boeing-777-200ER-JetBlue-JFK-takeoff.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:33:28.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"If you’ve been searching for flights down under, you’re in luck. These are usually some of the harder award tickets to come by using points and miles, but we’re seeing solid availability in business class for as few as 93,500 miles per person , with up to 4 award seats available on select dates . These seats are available in July and August via American Airlines AAdvantage miles . These award seats are likely to sell out quickly, so if you’re interested, book now and sort out your details later. Here’s what you need to know about booking this business class deal. Award Deal — Details We’re seeing business class availability on flights operated by American Airlines from Los Angeles to Australia over the next few months. While there’s availability for up to 2 passengers on most dates , you might get lucky and find up to 4 business class seats on some dates to Sydney. These nonstop flights can be booked starting at 93,500 miles . Those departing from other cities should be able to find these flights and pair them with a connection on a domestic AA flight to get to a starting point for these award tickets. Class:  Business Route:  Los Angeles (LAX) to Sydney (SYD) Cost:  From 93,500 American Airlines miles plus $27.50 Travel dates:  July to August 2026 Award seats:  Up to 2 passengers on most dates; scattered dates with up to 4 seats To compare multiple dates at once, you can use a tool like Seats.aero to help you find award space. Image Credit: Seats.aero Once you’ve found a flight that works for you, head to AA or Alaska’s website to book. You’ll find nonstop availability from 93,500 miles per person , with a moderately low cash portion varying slightly by destination. Image Credit: American Airlines » Related: How To Use Seats.aero To Find Award Availability How To Book Some dates are bookable for up to 4 passengers on this route ; however, you’ll likely find most dates with only 2 seats available, so flexibility can be helpful if you need seats for multiple passengers. These seats are available through the American Airlines AAdvantage program . Luckily, there are plenty of ways to  earn American AAdvantage miles . American Airlines has several co-branded credit cards  available, and you can transfer  Citi ThankYou Points  to AA at a 1:1 ratio if you have an eligible Citi credit card . Additionally, you can  earn Marriott Bonvoy points  and  transfer  those to American Airlines at a rate of 3:1. You can also earn AA miles by dining out , shopping online , and other non-travel activities . Hot Tip: For more inspiration, check out our complete guide covering the best ways to redeem American Airlines AAdvantage miles for maximum value . Final Thoughts Planning a trip to Australia in style just got easier, thanks to award availability using American Airlines miles. Flights are available nonstop from Los Angeles to Sydney for the next several weeks if you’ve got time off and want to book a great deal.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://tinhte.vn/rss/\",\"feedTitle\":\"Trang chủ\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=tinhte.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Xưa thích iPad M1 + ốp bàn phím Apple, bỏ balo nó nặng hơn cả con Macbook 16inch. Ráng không nổi...\",\"link\":\"https://tinhte.vn/thread/xua-thich-ipad-m1-op-ban-phim-apple-bo-balo-no-nang-hon-ca-con-macbook-16inch-rang-khong-noi.4161478/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftinhte.vn%2Fthread%2Fxua-thich-ipad-m1-op-ban-phim-apple-bo-balo-no-nang-hon-ca-con-macbook-16inch-rang-khong-noi.4161478%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dtinhte.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:32:04.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Xưa thích iPad M1 + ốp bàn phím Apple, bỏ balo cảm giác nó nặng hơn cả con Macbook 16inch. Ráng không nổi đổi qua iPad A16, ốp Wiwu và phím Razer Joro xài bền tới hiện tại. Quan trọng nhất là bỏ balo hay túi đeo chéo nhẹ nhàng.\",\"replyCount\":16,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Dow member 3M reports earnings next week. JPMorgan is bullish ahead of the report\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/17/3m-reports-earnings-next-week-jpmorgan-is-bullish-ahead-of-the-report.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F17%2F3m-reports-earnings-next-week-jpmorgan-is-bullish-ahead-of-the-report.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:30:48.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"The bank upgraded the Dow Jones Industrial Average component to overweight from neutral.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/chuyen-tro-linh-tinh-tm.17/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Chuyện trò linh tinh™\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voz.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Hỏi về việc phường đi kiểm tra hộ kinh doanh cá nhân.\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/hoi-ve-viec-phuong-di-kiem-tra-ho-kinh-doanh-ca-nhan.1261488/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fhoi-ve-viec-phuong-di-kiem-tra-ho-kinh-doanh-ca-nhan.1261488&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dvoz.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:25:48.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-07-17T21:22:39+0700\",\"content\":\"Chào các bác. Em mới đăng kí hộ kinh doanh cá nhân năm này (từ tháng 4). Thì đợt này có thông báo hẹn ngày kiểm tra từ phường, thì em cần chuẩn bị giấy tờ gì ạ, có bác nào từng gặp case này chưa ạ. E làm phần mềm, nhưng lúc đăng kí địa chỉ kd thì e ghi theo địa chỉ tạm trú (ở trọ) ạ. Không biết chủ trọ có bị sao k các bác.\",\"replyCount\":14,\"viewCount\":419},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100003114\",\"feedTitle\":\"US Top News and Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cnbc.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Business\",\"title\":\"Netflix earnings were a 'murky mosaic.' Analysts say stock upside will be limited by growth concerns\",\"link\":\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/07/17/netflix-gets-price-target-cuts-from-analysts-amid-growth-concerns.html\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.cnbc.com%2F2026%2F07%2F17%2Fnetflix-gets-price-target-cuts-from-analysts-amid-growth-concerns.html&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dcnbc.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:22:16.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Several shops on the Street lowered their price targets on Netflix's shares following the streaming platform's earnings report on Thursday.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/feed/\",\"feedTitle\":\"UpgradedPoints.com\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=upgradedpoints.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Others\",\"title\":\"[Award Alert] Japan Airlines Business Class Availability From 60K Miles\",\"link\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/news/award-alert-japan-airlines-business-class/\",\"image\":\"https://upgradedpoints.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/Japan-Airlines-A350-1000-business-middle-seats-boarding.jpg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T14:17:43.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Famous for its authentic onboard cuisine, extremely comfortable seats, and exceptional customer service, Japan Airlines offers one of the best experiences in the sky — regardless of the cabin you travel in. But if you are looking to arrive in Japan in comfort and style, we found award availability from the U.S. to Tokyo starting at just 60,000 miles in business class . This is a great price on an excellent airline — let’s take a look at the details. Japan Airlines Award Alert — The Details Thanks to its incredible mix of culture, food, fashion, and more, Tokyo continues to be one of the most popular travel destinations in the world. Fortunately for you, we found a fresh batch of  Japan Airlines business class award seats, so you can get there comfortably. We are seeing availability from several West Coast cities. Here’s how much it will cost and how you can book: Airline: Japan Airlines Award program: American Airlines AAdvantage and Alaska Airlines Atmos Rewards Class:  Business Route: Chicago (ORD), Los Angeles (LAX), San Diego (SAN), and San Francisco (SFO) to Tokyo Cost : As few as 60,000 miles plus $5.60 in taxes Travel dates: July through August 2026 Award seats:  Up to 4 passengers per route For starters, you’ll want to use a tool like Seats.aero , which lets you see multiple months and multiple routes at once, which can help you zero in on availability. Image Credit: Seats.aero Here’s an example of an itinerary from Chicago (ORD), which you can book for as few as 60,000 American Airlines AAdvantage miles and enjoy nearly 13 hours of lie-flat business class to Tokyo on Japan Airlines . Image Credit: American Airlines If you don’t have enough AAdvantage miles, you can instead book the same award with Alaska Atmos Rewards for a bit more from 75,000 points and approximately $26 in taxes and fees . Image Credit: Alaska Airlines Just note that American Airlines flights may also be available, so be sure to look for “ Operated by Japan Airlines ” in small print under the flight numbers if you want the best flying experience. » Related: I Flew to Tokyo for 48 Hours: Here’s My Full Itinerary and Costs How To Book There are multiple ways to book these awards, but your best options are through American AAdvantage or Alaska Atmos Rewards. American Airlines has several co-branded credit cards , and you can transfer Citi ThankYou Points to AA at a 1:1 ratio if you have an eligible Citi credit card. Additionally, you can earn Marriott Bonvoy points and transfer those to American Airlines at a rate of 3:1. You also can earn AA miles through online shopping , dining out , and other non-travel activities. If you prefer to redeem Alaska Airlines Atmos Rewards points , you can book these flights that way as well — and even transfer Bilt Rewards and Marriott Bonvoy to top off your balance. You can also earn Atmos Rewards points through an Alaska Airlines credit card , shopping through the Atmos Rewards Shopping portal , dining at restaurants that participate in Atmos Rewards Dining , or flying with Alaska’s Oneworld partners . Hot Tip: Want to know what it’s like to fly in business class on Japan Airlines? Here’s our review of Japan Airlines’ brand-new Airbus A350-1000 from New York to Tokyo. Final Thoughts If you haven’t booked your flight to Japan for this summer and want to get there in style, this is your chance. We’re seeing a solid amount of business class award availability for travel in July and August 2026. Flying business class on a long-haul international trip is one of the best ways to use your points and miles. Japan Airlines is one of our favorite carriers, and with cash fares often costing thousands of dollars, redeeming miles can unlock tremendous value. Availability this good rarely lasts long, so if Japan is on your summer travel list, now is the time to start booking.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://feeds.bloomberg.com/economics/news.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Bloomberg Economics\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=feed