s al Paraíso, A Rosewood Resort in Los Cabos Rosewood Mayakoba near Playa del Carmen Rosewood Mexico City (scheduled to open in 2027) However, the Rosewood San Miguel de Allende isn’t eligible for this offer. Guests who spend at least $750 at any of the 4 eligible Rosewood properties by October 31, 2026, will receive $150 back . The $750 spending requirement can be met in 1 or more transactions. Details of the offer. Image Credit: American Express Rosewood Hotels & Resorts is an ultra-luxury hospitality brand with 38 properties across 23 countries, each designed to reflect the local culture. As a true luxury brand, Rosewood stays don’t come cheap. That said, spending $750 to trigger this offer won’t be difficult. Expect rates over $600 per night in standard rooms during the low season, and rates closer to $1,000 per night during peak travel periods. If you’re already booking a fantastic getaway to a Rosewood property, putting $150 back in your pocket is a nice touch. Final Thoughts A new Amex Offer provides $150 back as a statement credit after spending at least $750 at Rosewood Hotels properties in Mexico by October 31. Given the caliber of Rosewood’s properties, spending over $750 isn’t difficult, and any cash-back is an easy win.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/302.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Cryptocurrency Opinion & Analysis\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.investing.com&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"Japan’s Crypto Overhaul Could Open the Door to a Wave of Institutional Money\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/japans-crypto-overhaul-could-open-the-door-to-a-wave-of-institutional-money-200684138\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fanalysis%2Fjapans-crypto-overhaul-could-open-the-door-to-a-wave-of-institutional-money-200684138&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dwww.investing.com%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDat