thing you need to know Viator Amex Offers Details If you have an eligible Amex card and have been targeted for this offer, you can receive a $40 statement credit by using your enrolled eligible card to spend a minimum of $250 in online purchases at viator.com by September 17, 2026 . You can receive the $40 credit twice, earning up to $80 back. Image Credit: American Express As with other Amex offers, you must first enroll your card before booking to trigger the credit , and you must pay with the card you added the offer to in order to get the credit. Note, too, that the $250 minimum spending requirement must be met in a single purchase to trigger the $40 savings. Many Amex Offers allow you to meet the spending requirement across multiple purchases, but offer from Viator requires spending the full amount in a single transaction. Note that this offer only applies to purchases made in U.S. dollars from the U.S. version of the Viator website. How To Access Amex Offers Amex Offers are available via the American Express website or your Amex mobile app . Simply log in and click the offers available to you under each card you have. You may notice different Amex Offers across your various cards and may only be targeted for certain promotions. As such, it’s wise to check each of your Amex card accounts (if you have more than 1) to make sure you’re not missing out on any offers such as this one. » Related: The Best Current Amex Offers [Travel, Dining, Entertainment, Shopping] Pair These Amex Offers With Rakuten Even better, you can receive 8% in cash-back on certain Viator purchases. Even better, though, Rakuten allows users to choose between earning cash-back or points. You can get your earnings as 8x Amex Membership Rewards or Bilt Rewards points, and we think that’s even more valuable than the cash-back option. Image Credit: Rakuten That means that if you want to book a tour or activity for an upcoming trip, you may be able to stack this Amex Offer with 8x earnings at Rakuten to both save money and earn cash-back (or points) effortlessly. Hot Tip: Not a Rakuten user? Using our referral links to sign up can give you $50 (or 50,000 points) after completing your first online shopping trip. Final Thoughts If you’re considering booking a tour for your upcoming vacation through Viator, it’s worth checking your Amex cards to see if you’re eligible for this Amex Offer. If you are, make sure to stack with Rakuten to receive the best possible earnings along the way. This Amex Offer provides up to $80 in statement credits through September 17, 2026.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://tinhte.vn/rss/\",\"feedTitle\":\"Trang chủ\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=tinhte.vn&sz=64\",\"feedCategory\":\"Tech\",\"title\":\"Liên minh Châu Âu lại ép Google mở cửa Android cho AI bên thứ ba rồi anh em!\",\"link\":\"https://tinhte.vn/thread/lien-minh-chau-au-lai-ep-google-mo-cua-android-cho-ai-ben-thu-ba-roi-anh-em.4161340/\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftinhte.vn%2Fthread%2Flien-minh-chau-au-lai-ep-google-mo-cua-android-cho-ai-ben-thu-ba-roi-anh-em.4161340%2F&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.google.com%2Fs2%2Ffavicons%3Fdomain%3Dtinhte.vn%26sz%3D64\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-17T12:45:59.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"Liên minh Châu Âu lại ép Google mở cửa Android cho AI bên thứ ba rồi anh em! Ủy ban Châu Âu vừa bắt Google phải cấp quyền truy cập tính năng hệ thống Android cho các dịch vụ AI bên thứ ba bình đẳng như Gemini. Google có hạn đến ngày 1/8/2027 để mở 11 tính năng, từ kích hoạt bằng giọng nói đến truy cập dữ liệu ngữ cảnh. Khác với Apple hoãn Siri AI ở EU, Google chọn tung Gemini ra trước rồi giải quyết pháp lý sau. Dù Google lo ngại quy định này sẽ ảnh hưởng tới tính bảo mật và quyền riêng... Liên minh Châu Âu lại ép Google mở cửa Android cho AI bên thứ ba rồi anh em!\",\"replyCount\":5,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/stock.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Stock Ma