am.jpeg\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-13T15:37:25.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"If you’re planning trips for this summer, Breeze Airways has a new sale that could help you save on an upcoming flight. The airline has launched a new sale with one-way fares starting at just $35 . You’ll need to book by July 23 , and the discounted fares are valid for travel between September 5 and October 5, 2026 . Let’s take a closer look at the details to see if this sale is actually worth booking. Save on Breeze Flights With One-Way Fares From $35 The latest Breeze sale offers one-way fares from $35 when you book by 11:59 p.m. PT on July 23, 2026 . There is no promo code required for this sale. Eligible travel dates for this sale are from September 5 to October 5, 2026 — an ideal window for a getaway across multiple months this summer. Note that some blackout dates apply for this sale. The latest Breeze Airways sale offers cheap flights from $35 one-way. Image Credit: Alberto Riva If you find a route that works for you, it’s worth pricing it out directly on Breeze’s website. Keep in mind, though, that the lowest Breeze fare types don’t include much besides the flight itself . That being said, if that isn’t a deal breaker for you, you can find some great deals. For example, we found one-way flights between Las Vegas (LAS) and Provo (PVU), Utah, starting at just $30 — even lower than the advertised $35 starting price . As always, the best deals are limited to select routes and travel dates, so it’s worth checking a few different dates to find the lowest fares. Image Credit: Breeze Since Breeze Airways is a budget airline, you’ll pay extra for checked bags and other add-ons besides the seat and a personal item. However, the carrier has a variety of fare bundles that include extras, potentially saving you money compared to booking them individually. At the highest end, the Nicest Bundle includes 2 checked bags, a premium seat, priority boarding, drinks, and other perks. Hot Tip: Check out our full guide to familiarize yourself with all things Breeze , including seats and amenities, customer service, fees, and more! Final Thoughts Breeze Airways’ latest sale is worth a look, especially with one-way flights starting at $35 (or even less) . If you find a route that lines up with your plans, this could be a good opportunity to lock in some savings for this summer. In order to take advantage, make sure you book your flights by July 23.\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://voz.vn/f/phan-mem.13/index.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Phần mềm\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/voz.vn.ico\",\"feedCategory\":\"Forum\",\"title\":\"Hỏi về các gói cước AI của chatgpt, gemini,...\",\"link\":\"https://voz.vn/t/hoi-ve-cac-goi-cuoc-ai-cua-chatgpt-gemini.1241024/unread\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fvoz.vn%2Ft%2Fhoi-ve-cac-goi-cuoc-ai-cua-chatgpt-gemini.1241024&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Ficons.duckduckgo.com%2Fip3%2Fvoz.vn.ico\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-13T15:33:38.000Z\",\"createDate\":\"2026-05-19T23:40:50+0700\",\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":22,\"viewCount\":3000,\"articleBody\":\"\"},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://www.investing.com/rss/stock.rss\",\"feedTitle\":\"Stock Markets Analysis & Opinion\",\"feedIcon\":\"https://icons.duckduckgo.com/ip3/www.investing.com.ico\",\"feedCategory\":\"Investing\",\"title\":\"Why WD-40 Is Proving Great Businesses Never Go Out of Style\",\"link\":\"https://www.investing.com/analysis/why-wd40-is-proving-great-businesses-never-go-out-of-style-200683827\",\"image\":\"/api/og-image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.investing.com%2Fanalysis%2Fwhy-wd40-is-proving-great-businesses-never-go-out-of-style-200683827&rss=&icon=https%3A%2F%2Ficons.duckduckgo.com%2Fip3%2Fwww.investing.com.ico\",\"pubDate\":\"2026-07-13T15:33:00.000Z\",\"createDate\":null,\"content\":\"\",\"replyCount\":0,\"viewCount\":0},{\"feedUrl\":\"https://search.cnbc.com/rs/search/combinedcms/view.xml?partnerId=wrss01&id=100727362\",\"feedTitle\":\